graph TD
    TMHG --> God4D
    God4D --> Word4D
    Word4D --> Universe
    Universe --> God3D

    God3D --> Evalute
    Evalute --> Logic & Propagate
    Logic --> Proof
    Proof --> NAND & NOR
    Propagate --> State
    State --> Step & Forward & Backward

    God3D --> Concieve
    Concieve --> Generate & Entity
    Generate --> Manifest
    Manifest --> Word3D & Context
    Entity --> Identity3D
    Identity3D --> Abstract & Subjective & Objective & Relative
    
    Abstract --> Properties2D
    Properties2D --> Attributes2D
    Attributes2D --> Observation2D
    Observation2D --> Idea2d

    Subjective --> Bias
    Bias --> Features
    Features --> Opinions
    Opinions --> Judgemets
    Judgemets --> Weights
    Weights --> Evaluations
    Evaluations --> Assements
    Assements --> Score & Word3D

    Objective --> environment
    environment --> views & Word2D & Event3D & Object3d
    views --> scene
    scene --> physics
    physics --> geometry
    geometry --> tetrahedron-sphere
    Word2D --> Definition & iWord
    Object3d --> inanimate & animate
    inanimate --> client
    animate --> human
    human --> God2D
    God2D --> person

    Relative --> Definitions2D
    Definitions2D --> References2D

    God3D --> Perceive
    Perceive --> Observe & Scope & Analyze & Interpret
    
    Observe --> Domain_obs[Domain] & Distance & Direction & Interval
    
    Scope --> Scale & Range & Analyze_scope[Analyze]
    Scale --> Size & Timeframe
    Size --> Min & Max
    Timeframe --> Begin & End
    Range --> Magnitude & Intensity
    Magnitude --> High & Low
    Intensity --> Strength & Quality
    
    Analyze --> Subject & Perspective
    Subject --> Status & Details
    Status --> Image & Statistics
    Details --> Static & Dynamic
    Perspective --> GraphContext
    GraphContext --> NodeContext
    NodeContext --> Geometry_node[Geometry]
    Geometry_node --> Size_geom[Size] & Vertices & Indices & Edges

    Interpret --> Domain_int[Domain] & Context & Model & Alignment
    
    Domain_int --> Private & Protected & Public & Definitions_dom[Definitions]
    Private --> extendedKey & sharedSignature
    Protected --> preSharedKey
    Public --> publicKey
    Definitions_dom --> Parameters & References & Attributes_def[Attributes] & Properties
    Parameters --> Features_param[Features] & Scores
    References --> Entites & Identities
    Attributes_def --> Observation2D_def[Observation2D]
    Observation2D_def --> Position & Scale_obs[Scale] & Rotation & Speed
    Properties --> Matrix & Center
    Matrix --> Uint16Array
    Center --> Point

    Context --> Auth & Merkle & PubSub & DHT
    Auth --> ExtendedKey & Signature
    Merkle --> Root_merkle[Root] & Leaf_merkle[Leaf]
    PubSub --> Root_pubsub[Root] & Leaf_pubsub[Leaf]
    DHT --> PubSub_dht[PubSub] & Key & Inbound & Outbound
    Inbound --> Hash_in[Hash] & Path_in[Path] & URL_in[URL] & Timestamp_in[Timestamp]
    Outbound --> Hash_out[Hash] & Path_out[Path] & URL_out[URL] & Timestamp_out[Timestamp]

    Model --> Features_model[Features] & Weights_model[Weights] & Biases & Layer
    Features_model --> Angle
    Angle --> Vertex & Arms
    Arms --> Common & Adjecent
    Weights_model --> Object4D
    Object4D --> Index & Attributes_obj[Attributes] & Refrences & Parameters_obj[Parameters]
    Index --> Uint16Array_obj[Uint16Array]
    Attributes_obj --> Position_obj[Position] & Scale_obj[Scale] & Rotation_obj[Rotation] & Matrix_obj[Matrix]
    Refrences --> Children
    Children --> Distance_child[Distance] & Matrix_child[Matrix]
    Parameters_obj --> Matrix_param[Matrix]
    Matrix_param --> Uint16Array_param[Uint16Array]
    
    Biases --> Ray
    Ray --> Origin & Destination & Near & Far
    Near --> Distance_near[Distance]
    Distance_near --> Number_near[Number]
    Far --> Distance_far[Distance]
    Distance_far --> Number_far[Number]

    Layer --> Neuron & Activation & Resolve & Learning
    Neuron --> Input & Output & Delta
    Activation --> Function
    Function --> Derive
    Derive --> sigmoid & tanh & relu & linear
    sigmoid --> extendedKey_sig[extendedKey] & sharedSignature_sig[sharedSignature]
    tanh --> preSharedKey_tanh[preSharedKey]
    relu --> publicKey_relu[publicKey]
    linear --> publicKey_linear[publicKey]
    Resolve --> Results & Error
    Results --> Token
    Token --> Value
    Error --> Loss
    Loss --> Graidents
    Learning --> Activte & Rate

    God3D --> Genesis3D
    Genesis3D --> Timestamp

